    /// <summary>🩺 핫리로드 워치독 결과 → 토스트(롤백/실패만 · 백그라운드 완료 → InvokeAsync).</summary>
    private async Task AwaitHotReloadWatchAsync(Task<PromptFlowStudio.Services.Export.HotReloadWatchResult> watch)
    {
        try
        {
            var w = await watch.ConfigureAwait(false);
            if (w.Outcome is not (PromptFlowStudio.Services.Export.HotReloadOutcome.RolledBack or PromptFlowStudio.Services.Export.HotReloadOutcome.RollbackFailed)) return;
            await InvokeAsync(() => { _camToast = w.Message; _stockToast = null; StateHasChanged(); });
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.HotReloadWatch", ex); }
    }
